			"notes": "**Fixed**\n- The mob farm accepted only entity cards; spawn eggs, spawner items and modded mob containers work again (a \"living entity\" check used `EntityType#getBaseClass()`, which answers `Entity.class` for every type).\n- The Auto Farm opened the mob farm's screen (its menu was registered under the wrong menu type).\n\n**Added**\n- Four random material cards: Ore, Crop, Tree and Plant. Put one in the matching machine and every batch draws a random sample of that category. Cards are not consumed and always produce something (empty draws are re-rolled).\n- The Auto Farm and the Auto Ore Farm now have a second output page, so a full output buffer no longer blocks production.\n\nBoth 1.21.1 and 26.1.2 builds are attached."
