			"notes": "**New machines**\n- **Simple Auto Fluid Farm** — 9 independent tanks with their own level bars, auto bucket filling, and the inner block renders the real fluid texture.\n- **Simple Auto Mob Farm** — feed it a spawn egg, a spawner item, a mob jar or any modded mob container; it runs the full death pipeline (affixes, gems, global loot modifiers) and outputs across two pages.\n\n**New items**\n- **Entity Card** — right-click a mob to bind it, then kill that mob to fill the card (requirement scales with base health, capped at 32 kills). Craft with paper to wipe it.\n- **Animal / Monster / Boss Entity Card** — randomly rolls a mob of that category every batch.\n\n**Also**\n- In-game config screen (NeoForge built-in) with three hot-editable options.\n- Machines no longer let pipes pull samples or upgrades out; generators only accept fuel and will not give it back (Pro lava included).\n\nBoth 1.21.1 and 26.1.2 builds are attached."
